  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges.\n• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and toss to coat. Bake until tender, 25-30 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672d65bb1cd01ca44ffc07ba-39f53535.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber and onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672d65bb1cd01ca44ffc07ba-e6450beb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the balsamic vinegar, the brown sugar and a splash of water and mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672d65bb1cd01ca44ffc07ba-0bb1085d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve bake-at home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack, until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672d65bb1cd01ca44ffc07ba-75dcbfbb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. TIP: Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672d65bb1cd01ca44ffc07ba-46cb0da5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread tomato relish over the bases of the burgers.\n• Top with mixed salad leaves, cucumber, haloumi and caramelised onion.\n• Serve with sweet potato wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672d65bb1cd01ca44ffc07ba-5ae48922.jpeg"
    }
  ]
